.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-skills \- Manage glab agent skills. (EXPERIMENTAL)


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab skills  [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Install the bundled glab agent skills so that AI agents can discover
and use glab effectively.

.PP
Skills follow the Agent Skills specification
\[la]https://agentskills.io/home\[ra] and work with
any compatible agent, including GitLab Duo Agent Platform, Claude Code, Codex,
and Gemini CLI.

.PP
This feature is an experiment and is not ready for production use.
It might be unstable or removed at any time.
For more information, see
https://docs.gitlab.com/policy/development_stages_support/.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
